mily:Aptos\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">A simple fix, could also be to have the number of rouse check be (Vitae+1)/2 rounded up. The table would then look like this.</span></span></span> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table_MsoTable15Grid5Dark\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_MsoTable15Grid5Dark_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_MsoTable15Grid5Dark_td\" style=\"background-color: black\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos\"><b><span style=\"color:white\">Base Vitae </span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Aptos\"><b><span style=\"color:white\">Cost</span></b></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_MsoTable15Grid5Dark_td\" style=\"background-color: black\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos\"><b><span style=\"color:white\">Base Rouse </span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Aptos\"><b><span style=\"color:white\">Checks</span></b></span></td> <td colspan=\"4\" class=\"text_table_MsoTable15Grid5Dark_td\" style=\"background-color: black\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos\"><b><span style=\"color:white\">Reduction Effect</span></b></span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_MsoTable15Grid5Dark_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_MsoTable15Grid5Dark_td\" style=\"background-color: black\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_MsoTable15Grid5Dark_td\" style=\"background-color: black\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_MsoTable15Grid5Dark_td\" style=\"background-color: black\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos\"><b><span style=\"color:white\">-1</span></b></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_MsoTable15Grid5Dark_td\" style=\"background-color: black\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos\"><b><span style=\"color:white\">-2</span></b></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_MsoTable15Grid5Dark_td\" style=\"background-color: black\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos\"><b><span style=\"color:white\">-3</span></b></span></td> <td class=\"text_table_MsoTable15Grid5Dark_td\" style=\"background-color: bla